sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant API as UsersController
    participant Service as IdentityService
    participant Store as IdentityStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Admin->>+UI: Open User Management

    UI->>+API: List users(filters)
    API->>+Service: ListUsersAsync(query)

    Service->>+Store: Retrieve user accounts
    Store->>+DB: SELECT users with role and status filters
    DB-->>Store: User records
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: User list
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: Paged user results
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: User accounts
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display user list
    deactivate UI

    opt Administrator manages an account

        Admin->>+UI: Select management action

        alt Create User Account

            UI->>+API: Create(userData)
            API->>+Service: CreateUserAsync(userData)

            Service->>+Store: Validate and create user
            Store->>+DB: SELECT duplicate identity / INSERT user
            DB-->>Store: Created account or validation error
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Creation result
            deactivate Store

            Service-->>API: Created user or error
            deactivate Service

            API-->>UI: Success or error response
            deactivate API

        else Update User Profile

            UI->>+API: UpdateProfile(userId, profileData)
            API->>+Service: UpdateProfileAsync(userId, profileData)

            Service->>+Store: Update user information
            Store->>+DB: SELECT target account / UPDATE profile
            DB-->>Store: Updated account or error
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Profile update result
            deactivate Store

            Service-->>API: Updated profile or error
            deactivate Service

            API-->>UI: Success or error response
            deactivate API

        else Update User Role

            UI->>+API: UpdateRole(userId, role)
            API->>+Service: UpdateRoleAsync(userId, role)

            Service->>+Store: Validate and update user role
            Store->>+DB: SELECT target account / UPDATE role
            DB-->>Store: Updated role or error
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Role update result
            deactivate Store

            Service-->>API: Updated role or error
            deactivate Service

            API-->>UI: Success or error response
            deactivate API

        else Activate or Deactivate Account

            UI->>+API: UpdateStatus(userId, isActive)
            API->>+Service: SetActiveStatusAsync(userId, isActive)

            Service->>+Store: Update account status
            Store->>+DB: UPDATE account status and revoke sessions if needed
            DB-->>Store: Updated status or error
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Status update result
            deactivate Store

            Service-->>API: Updated status or error
            deactivate Service

            API-->>UI: Success or error response
            deactivate API

        else Assign or Unassign Access Scope

            UI->>+API: Assign or Unassign user scope

            Note over API,Service: Warehouse, Region, Sales Group or Retailer

            API->>+Service: Assign or Unassign scope

            Service->>+Store: Validate and update user assignment
            Store->>+DB: SELECT scope / INSERT or UPDATE assignment
            DB-->>Store: Assignment result or error
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Assignment result
            deactivate Store

            Service-->>API: Updated scope or error
            deactivate Service

            API-->>UI: Success or error response
            deactivate API

        end

        UI-->>Admin: Display operation result
        deactivate UI

    end